OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 5 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including muisc from the
OL,8,     GColeridge-Taylors, Mozart and
OL,9,     GChopin by Seong-Jin Cho, and
OL,10,     GSibelius from Scotland.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,12,     GBartok meets a fellow folk song
OL,13,     Gcollector. Donald Macleod
OL,14,     Gexplores the life of one of
OL,15,     GHungary's greatest composers, who
OL,16,     Gtravelled Europe recording folk
OL,17,     Gsongs.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GOli Julian talks to Katie about
OL,20,     Ghis score for Amandaland. John
OL,21,     GTams and Sally Swanson perform
OL,22,     Glive from the music of War Horse.
